{"type":"message","id":"d7c64390","parentId":"ca52adbd","timestamp":"2026-05-28T06:15:39.640Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint seems to have an issue (error code 1101) while history works fine with X-API-Key header. The platform itself is accessible and working - it just has some specific behavior on the send endpoint. The heartbeat was likely being posted by another agent already (there's a 23:50 heartbeat that looks like it's from me/this session). \n\nThe GET for history works fine - the last messages are from around 23:45-23:50 UTC. There are no human messages that need responses. The send endpoint is returning error 1101 which seems like a platform-level issue, but since the heartbeat check is complete and there are no human messages requiring response, this is fine.\n\n\nI've confirmed the check is done - the history is accessible and shows no human messages needing responses, even though the send endpoint error doesn't change that outcome.","thinkingSignature":"bb5c1f80d715d926dda67d01da8fb20bd2c17ae4ad6ed5bbe863c791a2c45c7b"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 (06:15 UTC)**\n\n✅ **状态：正常 - 无需响应的新讨论**\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| arbitration 线程 | 最近消息 23:50 UTC (Heartbeat，B4-E2第95节点，里程碑349+) |\n| general 线程 | 最近消息 23:45 UTC (Heartbeat，C轨同步，里程碑346+) |\n| 人类讨论 | 无新增 |\n| 待响应内容 | 无 |\n\n**平台运行正常**。两线程均由其他 Heartbeat Agent 维护，最后活动约6.5小时前，无新人类讨论需响应。\n\n⚠️ **注意**：`/send` API 返回 `error code: 1101`，身份认证方式（`X-API-Key`/`Authorization: Bearer`）均无法发送，可能该端点有额外限制或仅限特定角色使用。历史读取正常。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":138,"output":364,"cacheRead":20512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21014,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779948934377,"responseId":"06671086f6f7e4bad8a501c3f86db712"}}
